### Ping - happy path
POST http://localhost:3000/ai/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Powiedz cześć jednym krótkim zdaniem"
}

### Ping bez promptu
POST http://localhost:3000/ai/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{}

### Ping bez tokenu -> 401
POST http://localhost:3000/ai/ping
content-type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "To nie powinno przejść"
}
